flowchart TD
    Start([Start: AdminViewNewQueries]) --> Input[/Input: admin_id/]
    Input --> QUsers[(Query USERS & ROLE Tables)]
    QUsers --> CheckRole{Role == Admin?}
    
    CheckRole -- No --> Err1[/Return Error: Unauthorized/]
    CheckRole -- Yes --> QQueries[(Query D3: QUERIES where status = Open)]
    QQueries --> Sort[Sort by created_at ascending]
    Sort --> LoopStart{More queries to process?}
    
    LoopStart -- Yes --> QStudent[(Query USERS: student_id)]
    QStudent --> Combine[Combine query + student details]
    Combine --> InsertList[Insert into admin_dashboard_view]
    InsertList --> LoopStart
    
    LoopStart -- No --> Output[/Return Success: admin_dashboard_view/]
    Output --> End([End])
    
    Err1 --> End